("v625", "scalar", "The four posts mix Sarfatti's own proposals with quotations, summaries and AI-generated dialogue concerning Altaisky's wavelet QFT and Simon Daniel's AI/E8 paper. Claimipedia therefore attributes the act of posting and synthesis to Sarfatti while preserving Altaisky and Daniel as the originating claimants for their respective material. The exchange's concessions—no direct published mass window for the three proposed Proca sectors, no derived source stress tensor, and no explicit covariant action—are retained as first-class evidence boundaries rather than omitted as criticism.")
