("v712", "type", "String")
("v712", "scalar", "The repository, paper, scripts and numerical claims are attributed to Sharpe and Project 89. Claimipedia independently reproduced the headline 137.032051 and static-control 143.134258 arithmetic from the printed formula, but did not execute the supplied SciPy scripts because SciPy is absent from the local runtime. The repository's own verification script labels K_bulk=z K_BKT^2 and the 1/sqrt(e) exponent as conjectures; the paper states that the ppb linked-cluster embedding weight lacks a rigorous first-principles derivation. Admission preserves those internal boundaries and does not treat agreement with CODATA as independent validation.")
