("v946", "scalar", "This source is Claimipedia's analysis of recurring problem-solving moves in Weinstein's dissertation, gauge-theoretic economics, Graph-Wall-Tome programme and Geometric Unity. It distinguishes Weinstein's stated ideas from editorial search operators. Criticism is version-locked and technically reconstructed; neither author nor critic receives authority by reputation. A local roadblock closes only the tested branch, not the first-class programme.")
