("v2472", "key", "attributedClaim")
("v2473", "type", "String")
("v2473", "scalar", "A Monster/arithmetic/automorphic correspondence plus orthogonality, an untwisted bound and analytic translation might yield zero-free information for an untwisted L-function such as zeta(s)L(s,chi_-3).")
("v2472", "value", "v2473")
("v2465", "entry", "v2474")
("v2474", "type", "Entry")
("v2474", "key", "steelman")
("v2475", "type", "String")
("v2475", "scalar", "Trace formulas, automorphic correspondences and representation-theoretic cancellation can sometimes convert symmetry into analytic bounds. A credible programme would identify a natural family whose nontrivial sectors control coefficients while the invariant sector is isolated, then prove bounds strong enough to imply a precisely stated zero-free region.")
("v2474", "value", "v2475")
