("v2477", "item", "v2479")
("v2480", "type", "String")
("v2480", "scalar", "Prove orthogonality controls the required non-averaged or untwisted sums")
("v2477", "item", "v2480")
("v2481", "type", "String")
("v2481", "scalar", "Obtain bounds at the strength and uniformity demanded by the target zero-free region")
("v2477", "item", "v2481")
("v2482", "type", "String")
("v2482", "scalar", "Justify analytic continuation and translate the bound to nonvanishing")
("v2477", "item", "v2482")
("v2483", "type", "String")
("v2483", "scalar", "State whether the target concerns zeta, L(s,chi_-3), their product or an RH-equivalent object")
