("v4203", "type", "String")
("v4203", "scalar", "Spin(2,3) is in the same B2/C2 Lie-type neighborhood as a finite symplectic subgroup occurring in the Monster.")
("v4202", "value", "v4203")
("v4195", "entry", "v4204")
("v4204", "type", "Entry")
("v4204", "key", "steelman")
("v4205", "type", "String")
("v4205", "scalar", "The identity Spin(2,3) isomorphic to Sp4(R) places the physical kernel in real type C2. The ATLAS records the explicit subgroup chain PSp4(4) < PSp4(4):2 < He < Monster. RIO-018 now supplies three constructive steps: the natural eight-dimensional F2 carrier has commutant exactly F4; that carrier plus its outer twist occur as internal subquotients of the ATLAS 51-dimensional Held module; and the ordinary Monster character of degree 196883 restricts to Held with multiplicity nine for each conjugate degree-51 character.")
("v4204", "value", "v4205")
("v4195", "entry", "v4206")
