("v4282", "type", "Entry")
("v4282", "key", "steelman")
("v4283", "type", "String")
("v4283", "scalar", "The audit found one universal real bridge and one failed join. The genus-two weight-12 numerator reaches D(12,0) with Casimir 108, but c=24 collision controls show that this carrier is not Monster-specific. Scalar twining remains centralizer-invariant; by Schur's lemma a nontrivial commuting finite-group action must live on a multiplicity space W. Independently, the finite PSp4(4) natural module recovers F4 as its commutant and occurs inside a Held module reached by the ordinary Monster character. No canonical module or functor joins the characteristic-two and real carriers, and the level-one oldform has trivial finite deck action, so the two lanes remain valid shadows rather than one established phase change.")
("v4282", "value", "v4283")
