("v4571", "type", "String")
("v4571", "scalar", "PSp4(4):2 is maximal in He and is reached from F4(2) through the exact maximal-subgroup chain F4(2) > Sp8(2) > PSp4(4):2. RIO-018 constructs a reducible 26-dimensional invariant filtration stage on the Held side, while F4(2) has a canonical irreducible 26-dimensional F2 module from the trace-zero Albert algebra. Once both subgroup embeddings and the exact Held-stage basis are pinned, restriction to the shared abstract subgroup creates a finite, decisive module-isomorphism test.")
