("v5265", "scalar", "After rewriting a modified-gravity theory as Einstein geometry plus an effective source, extra fields can carry the negative null projection. This can change localization, stability and engineering constraints, but Raychaudhuri focusing tests the total effective source, so sector relocation does not erase the sign or quantum-inequality burden.")
("v5264", "value", "v5265")
