("v5339", "type", "String")
("v5339", "scalar", "The physical vacuum is a Dirac-sea plasma whose condensates give masses to torsion, dilation and special-conformal components of a local SO(2,4) connection coupled to the Standard Model, with those components potentially much more strongly coupled than Newtonian gravity.")
("v5338", "value", "v5339")
("v5331", "entry", "v5340")
("v5340", "type", "Entry")
("v5340", "key", "steelman")
("v5341", "type", "String")
("v5341", "scalar", "A conformal gauge theory with compensators or condensates can in principle break SO(2,4), generate massive connection modes and leave an Einstein-like infrared sector. The proposal becomes a model only when the vacuum, invariant action, symmetry-breaking map, matter currents and healthy linearized spectrum are derived together.")
("v5340", "value", "v5341")
