("v5379", "type", "String")
("v5379", "scalar", "A geodesic warp bubble can reproduce abrupt coordinate acceleration, negligible occupant proper acceleration, weak conventional propulsion signatures and related UAP-like observables, but only after an exotic wall source has been assumed; exterior-calculus identities do not remove the null-energy violation.")
