("v5381", "type", "String")
("v5381", "scalar", "The source bundle correctly isolates a conditional kinematic result: given a suitable metric and source, proper and coordinate acceleration can differ sharply. This is a useful observable dictionary, but it neither constructs the source nor shows that a quantum or condensed-matter stress tensor can support the geometry.")
