("v5494", "key", "steelman")
("v5495", "type", "String")
("v5495", "scalar", "Path dependence, bounded observers, multiscale operators and physically constrained search are respectable ingredients for modelling adaptive open systems. Their strongest defensible form is a programme to test whether a specified structured substrate improves novelty, control or search efficiency—not a present derivation of consciousness, safety, particle masses or a general NP-to-P collapse.")
