("v5717", "type", "String")
("v5717", "scalar", "The same Lyapunov ceiling 2 pi k_B T/hbar links stabilized imaginary-time instanton fluctuations, photon-ring or horizon dynamics and many-body scars supported by unstable periodic orbits, suggesting a unified holographic model.")
