("v5718", "key", "steelman")
("v5719", "type", "String")
("v5719", "scalar", "The three literatures share quantitative observables involving instability exponents, temperature and unstable orbits. A useful synthesis would compare the operators, states, clocks and temperatures side by side and ask whether one transfer matrix or semiclassical saddle controls more than one realization.")
