("v5792", "type", "String")
("v5792", "scalar", "Open-string degrees of freedom on dense D-instanton arrays can generate regular D-branes and rolling-tachyon configurations through marginal deformations, allowing D-branes to appear as classical solutions of the proposed vacuum theory.")
