("v5867", "key", "steelman")
("v5868", "type", "String")
("v5868", "scalar", "A bounded observer can be represented as a structure-preserving coarse-graining or selection map over a computational state-transition system. Calling it a functor becomes substantive if the source categories, morphisms, target category and preservation laws are explicitly typed and independently checkable.")
