("v5904", "key", "steelman")
("v5905", "type", "String")
("v5905", "scalar", "The four domains may be treated as a proposed multiscale state-space partition: physical dynamics, goal-directed control, symbolic computation and weakly constrained possibility. It becomes scientific if membership and cross-domain maps are fixed independently of the examples they are meant to explain.")
