("v6269", "key", "steelman")
("v6270", "type", "String")
("v6270", "scalar", "QPT offers a coherent descriptive vocabulary for the observations: a shared domain supplies constraints, learning dynamics approach different basins, and out-of-distribution inputs can yield stable but impoverished representations. The empirical patterns are compatible with that schema. They become confirmation only if the mapping was fixed in advance and beats rival convergence accounts on risky predictions.")
