("v6343", "type", "String")
("v6343", "scalar", "A narrow, dataset-stable intrinsic dimension can indicate a common effective number of variables required by a task and domain. The paper itself finds different dimensions across datasets and systematic effects from invariance/equivariance, so the strongest warranted claim is a domain-, task- and symmetry-conditioned effective dimension—not an architecture-independent ontological dimension of matter.")
