("v6488", "type", "String")
("v6488", "scalar", "For particular universal or undecidable systems, no general shortcut exists for every input. In a research programme this supports an empirical execution lane, but it does not prove that every observed instance is irreducible or exempt finite cases from algorithms, bounds and compression tests.")
