("v7576", "type", "String")
("v7576", "scalar", "Quartz grains are piezoelectric, so stressed granite can exhibit a measurable aggregate electromechanical response depending on grain orientation, contacts, conductivity and stress. The relevant question is whether the assembled masonry produces coherent voltage or useful power above triboelectric, electrokinetic and instrumental backgrounds.")
