("v7864", "scalar", "Indentations or hollowing have been reported and can be mapped photogrammetrically, but recent scholarship disputes a pristine intentional folded-face interpretation and argues that the visible feature may reflect core condition, lost casing, construction technique or later history. Equinox visibility is not itself a design proof.")
