("v7900", "type", "String")
("v7900", "scalar", "Treat J3(O_s) as a tightly specified organising algebra whose Peirce structure, determinant and automorphisms may constrain candidate maps into Standard Model observables. The respectable claim is not that numerical proximity proves the framework, but that one frozen algebraic dictionary might generate a portfolio of linked, prospectively testable relations with less discretion than unrelated curve fits.")
