("v7934", "scalar", "The programme's scorecard gives algebraically motivated formulas for PMNS mixing observables, including sin^2(theta12)=3/(phi^4+3), sin^2(theta23)=7/16, sin^2(theta13)=sin^4(pi/8), and deltaCP=-2pi/sqrt(5) modulo 2pi.")
