("v7936", "type", "String")
("v7936", "scalar", "The formulas are compact and the programme itself distinguishes derived-conditional rows from structural and loaded-correspondence rows. A useful review can ask whether the two claimed derivation chains really close, whether the atmospheric-octant attachment was selected against data, and whether the portfolio survives comparison with equally simple constant expressions.")
