("v8805", "key", "steelman")
("v8806", "type", "String")
("v8806", "scalar", "Within the analytic bosonic OSFT tachyon-vacuum background, a homotopy operator satisfying {Q,A}=1 makes closed fluctuations BRST exact. This is a precise cohomological model of a localized open sector disappearing while closed-string observables remain accessible through gauge-invariant insertions.")
