("v8838", "key", "attributedClaim")
("v8839", "type", "String")
("v8839", "scalar", "For the open-string photon and a bulk graviton, the paper finds a vanishing linear overlap and a leading nonlinear effective operator equal to the graviton coupled to the Maxwell stress tensor, up to string corrections.")
