("v9143", "type", "String")
("v9143", "scalar", "A cylindrical mode separates an integer compact winding label from continuous axial momentum. Fourier duality rigorously couples localization and momentum spread, but Heisenberg uncertainty alone does not mix the angular and axial sectors. T1 and T2 become a physical coupling only after an explicit Hamiltonian contains terms that connect them.")
